{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/RunQuadRun.png?t=1752841663\" /></div>Run Quad Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Qubicland needs your reflexes and skills to recover the lost artifacts. Inspired by the difficult skill games of browser games era, Run Quad Run brings you a lot of new enemies and a colorful world to discover. Easy to learn, hard to master. With 500 unique levels, the game offers features to both starters and hardcore players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/Features.png?t=1752841663\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">500 Levels to Finish and Speedrun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 Colorful worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 Different enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 Long Rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemy Speed modifiers for starter players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race fast to Finish levels within the Target Time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hard Run Levels with World Speedrun for Hardcore Players and Real Runners</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/Never_Give_Up.png?t=1752841663\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Never Give Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're new to the genre, we've got you covered with a few features that'll help you easily play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">p.s. We recommend you to play the game on default difficulty. However, it is not mandatory. You can still get the achievements with the reduced difficulty settings. Can be found in the <strong>Gameplay Tab</strong> under <strong>Options</strong> menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/Real_Runners.png?t=1752841663\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Real Runners</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're on the hardcore side and you'd like to <strong>Speedrun</strong> the game, we also have a death counter and a global timer to count your cumulative stats. Can be found in the <strong>Gameplay Tab</strong> under <strong>Options</strong> menu.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3733970?t=1752841663","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/84de6ebdc9d611c4ccca17b64d0cacf60d453cd8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752841663","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/37a5a2ad43bd6a3a982d8cf0fbe98f084b2bf3a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752841663","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/37a5a2ad43bd6a3a982d8cf0fbe98f084b2bf3a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752841663","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/RunQuadRun.png?t=1752841663\" /></div>Run Quad Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Qubicland needs your reflexes and skills to recover the lost artifacts. Inspired by the difficult skill games of browser games era, Run Quad Run brings you a lot of new enemies and a colorful world to discover. Easy to learn, hard to master. With 500 unique levels, the game offers features to both starters and hardcore players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/Features.png?t=1752841663\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">500 Levels to Finish and Speedrun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 Colorful worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 Different enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20 Long Rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemy Speed modifiers for starter players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race fast to Finish levels within the Target Time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hard Run Levels with World Speedrun for Hardcore Players and Real Runners</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/Never_Give_Up.png?t=1752841663\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Never Give Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're new to the genre, we've got you covered with a few features that'll help you easily play the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">p.s. We recommend you to play the game on default difficulty. However, it is not mandatory. You can still get the achievements with the reduced difficulty settings. Can be found in the <strong>Gameplay Tab</strong> under <strong>Options</strong> menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/Real_Runners.png?t=1752841663\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Real Runners</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're on the hardcore side and you'd like to <strong>Speedrun</strong> the game, we also have a death counter and